2026-08-16T08:21:57.2642948Z [36;1m  empty_makevars="$(mktemp)"[0m
2026-08-16T08:21:57.2643237Z [36;1m  for var in CC CXX CXX11 CXX14 CXX17 CXX20 CXX23; do[0m
2026-08-16T08:21:57.2643679Z [36;1m    val="$(R_MAKEVARS_USER="$empty_makevars" R CMD config "$var" 2>/dev/null || true)"[0m
