2026-08-16T08:21:57.2647939Z [36;1m    wrapper="ccache-$(basename "$prog")"[0m
2026-08-16T08:21:57.2648188Z [36;1m[0m
2026-08-16T08:21:57.2648381Z [36;1m    if [ ! -f "$wrapper_dir/$wrapper" ]; then[0m
