2026-08-16T08:21:57.2663147Z [36;1m[0m
2026-08-16T08:21:57.2663409Z [36;1m# Do NOT export UserNM here, however tempting the `UserNM=true` trick[0m
2026-08-16T08:21:57.2663867Z [36;1m# from AGENTS.md looks. It is a development shortcut, not a CI setting.[0m
